        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Falkenberg wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Look at any 'good guy' active power and show me one that's close to bringing those Citizen cards to the game, I dare you.&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nUnity.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Also Bolstering Team Up.</p>\n<p>Because that power is insanely good.</p>",
